      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "adTargetingEntities",
      "Anchor": "adtargetingentities",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The LinkedIn ads platform allows advertisers to target different types of audiences on the professional network.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "adTargetingEntities",
      "Anchor": "adtargetingentities",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Use the Ad Targeting Entities API to discover valid values of a targeting type available.\u00A0Use in conjunction with the Ad Targeting Facets API.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "adTargetingEntities",
      "Anchor": "adtargetingentities",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This page should be used for reference purposes only. More comprehensive documentation with sample requests is available in Ad Targeting.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
